  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/T1cDttyv/farmers-knives-banner.png\" alt=\"農夫小刀\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為「農夫樂事」模組添加多種模組材料的刀子！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支援列表：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adabranium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adabranium</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">振金（Vibranium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">亞德曼合金（Adamantium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地獄磚（Nether Brick）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">玫瑰金（Rose Gold）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鍍金獄髓（Gilded Netherite）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓-鐵（Netherite-Iron）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓-金（Netherite-Gold）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓-綠寶石（Netherite-Emerald）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓-鑽石（Netherite-Diamond）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aphid-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aphid Additions</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">幾丁質（Chitin）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">薩拉辛（Thallasium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">終界晶石（Terminite）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">永恆鋼（Aeternium）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辛辛那石（Cincinnasite）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辛辛那石-鑽石（Cincinnasite-Diamond）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地獄紅寶石（Nether Ruby）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">魔力鋼（Manasteel）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">元素合金（Elementium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">大地鋼（Terrasteel）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conjuring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Conjuring</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">靈魂合金（Soul Alloy）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-age-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Age Backport</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅（Copper）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff and Additions</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">黃銅（Brass）<br>鋅（Zinc）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄卒（Warden）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragonloot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Loot</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">龍（Dragon）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-tools-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Emerald Tools &amp; More</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">綠寶石（Emerald）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">紅寶石（Ruby）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">紫水晶（Amethyst）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋼（Steel）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">黑曜石（Obsidian）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅（Copper）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-reborn-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Reborn</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">遺跡（Remnant）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">羽毛石（Featherzeal）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderite Mod</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">終界合金（Enderite）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">戈伯（Gobber）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地獄戈伯（Nether Gobber）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">終界戈伯（End Gobber）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">亞德曼礦（Adamantite）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">水族礦（Aquarium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">邦格姆（Banglum）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">青銅（Bronze）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">卡莫特（Carmot）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">天界礦（Celestium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅（Copper）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">耐鋼（Durasteel）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">聖化礦（Hallowed）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">凱博礦（Kyber）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">傳說邦格姆（Legendary Banglum）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">冶金金（Metallurgium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">祕銀（Mythril）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">山銅（Orichalcum）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋨（Osmium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鈀（Palladium）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">普羅米修礦（Prometheum）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">四角礦（Quadrillum）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">符文礦（Runite）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">星鉑（Star Platinum）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋼（Steel）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">風暴礦（Stormyx）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">潮汐礦（Tidesinger）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">潘多礦（Pendorite）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progression-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progression Reborn</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅（Copper）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">玫瑰（Rose）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林（The Twilight Forest）</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鐵木（Ironwood）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">熾熱鋼（Fiery）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋼葉（Steeleaf）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">騎士金屬（Knightmetal）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅（Copper）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Winterly</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">冰晶石（Cryomarble）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>2.1 版本的所有刀子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8zPxdqC/image-2022-08-17-164723137.png\" alt=\"刀子\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">（不含暮光森林、Adabranium、Advanced Netherite、Winterly、Mythic Metals 的 Tidesinger、Progression Reborn、End Reborn 及 Create Stuff &amp; Additions）</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>鳴謝：</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 The Skeleton Appears 提供 Mythic Metals 刀子的材質</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多建議請<a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/farmersknives/issues/1\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此提出</a>！</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;點擊下方任一連結查看我的其他作品：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qyYwHykSmE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KrWjv8p/discord-rectangle-500x160.png\" alt=\"加入 Discord 伺服器\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vmx15sd/download.png\" alt=\"我的 GitHub\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
